@startuml player_potions_and_actions

package player {
  class Player {
    -- フィールド(Fields) --
    - aura: ObjAura
    - inventory: List<Entity>
    - gameWindow: GameWindow
    - loaded: boolean
    - blockingLeft: boolean
    - holding: boolean
    - holdOffset: Map<String, Point>
    - currentWeapon: Entity
    - currentShield: Entity
    - direction: String
    - screenX: int
    - screenY: int

    -- ポーション(Potion) --
    + useRedPotion(index:int): void
    + useGreenPotion(index:int): void
    + useBluePotion(index:int): void

    -- 攻撃 / ガード(Attack / Guard) --
    - startAttack(): void
    - startGuard(): void
    - startBlockingLeft(): void
    - stopBlockingLeft(): void

    -- ヘルパー(Helpers） --
    + setLife(n:int): void
    + getLife(): int
    + getMaxLife(): int
    + setMana(n:int): void
    + getMana(): int
    + getMaxMana(): int
    + getInventory(): List<Entity>
    + getCurrentWeapon(): Entity
    + getCurrentShield(): Entity
    + getDirection(): String
    + hasLeftShield(): boolean
    + setGuarding(b:boolean): void
  }
}

package object {
  class ObjRedPotion {
    + getHealAmount(): int
    + getAmount(): int
    + setAmount(n:int): void
  }
  class ObjGreenPotion
  class ObjBluePotion
  class ObjSwordNormal
  class ObjShieldWood
  class ObjFireball
  class ObjBomb
  class ObjAura
  class ObjPot
  class ObjRock
}

package npc {
  class NpcChicken
}

package window {
  class GameWindow {
    + getUi(): UI
    + getSoundmanager(): SoundManager
  }
}

package ui {
  class UI {
    + getDamagePopupManager(): DamagePopupManager
  }
  class DamagePopupManager {
    + pop(text:String, x:int, y:int, variant:PopupVariant, duration:int): void
  }
}

package sound {
  class SoundManager {
    + redPotionWAV(path:String): void
    + greenPotionWAV(path:String): void
  }
}

package popup {
  enum PopupVariant
}

Player --> object.ObjRedPotion : uses (consumes)
Player --> object.ObjGreenPotion : uses (consumes)
Player --> object.ObjBluePotion : uses (consumes)
Player --> object.ObjSwordNormal : sets as currentWeapon
Player --> object.ObjShieldWood : sets as currentShield
Player --> object.ObjFireball : sets as projectile
Player --> object.ObjBomb : sets as projectile
Player --> object.ObjAura : uses (aura cache)
Player --> window.GameWindow : uses (UI / sound)
Player --> ui.DamagePopupManager : creates popups
Player --> sound.SoundManager : plays sounds
Player --> npc.NpcChicken : may hold (0..1)
Player --> object.ObjBomb : may hold (0..1)
Player --> object.ObjPot : may hold (0..1)
Player --> object.ObjRock : may hold (0..1)

note right of Player
**Notes**
- **useRedPotion / useGreenPotion / useBluePotion**:
- 指定インデックスのインベントリを検査し、該当ポーションなら回復処理・効果音・ポップアップ表示・スタック減少またはスロット削除を行う。
- RedPotion は満タン時に aura を発動する可能性がある。
- **startAttack / startGuard**:
- 装備中の武器/盾の種類と向きに応じて攻撃/ガード方向を設定し、対応するスプライト配列を更新する。
- **startBlockingLeft / stopBlockingLeft**:
- 左側ガードの開始/終了。盾の有無を確認してガード状態を切替える。

- **useRedPotion / useGreenPotion / useBluePotion**:
- Inspect the inventory at the specified index; if the item is the corresponding potion, apply healing, play the appropriate sound effect, show a popup, and decrement the stack or remove the slot.
- RedPotion may trigger the aura when HP is fully restored.
- **startAttack / startGuard**:
- Set the attack or guard direction based on the equipped weapon or shield type and the player’s facing, then switch to the corresponding attack/guard sprite arrays.
- **startBlockingLeft / stopBlockingLeft**:
- Begin or end left-side blocking; check whether a shield is equipped and toggle the guarding state accordingly.
end note

@enduml